# Rules for AI Assistant
- Do NOT read all files in the project. Read files on demand only.
- For screenshot or UI edit requests, search for the visible text (English/Arabic) in the codebase using search tools to identify the component instantly.
- Make targeted edits, do not rewrite whole files unnecessarily.
- Keep token usage minimal and responses concise.
- Tech stack: React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS + Supabase.
